    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a brain-teasing puzzle game where you need to use the gravity gun to control the weight of a cube, switching between three modes: superheavy, weightless, and normal. Use this mechanic to think through the puzzles I\u2019ve set. The game features thirty carefully designed levels, each with its own unique challenges. If you\u2019ve played <i>Portal</i>, you\u2019ll understand what I mean.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a brain-teasing puzzle game where you need to use the gravity gun to control the weight of a cube, switching between three modes: superheavy, weightless, and normal. Use this mechanic to think through the puzzles I\u2019ve set. The game features thirty carefully designed levels, each with its own unique challenges. If you\u2019ve played <i>Portal</i>, you\u2019ll understand what I mean.</p>",
    "short_description": "This is a platformer puzzle game where the core mechanic is the gravity-reversing gun in your hand. It allows you to change the mass of objects, so use it to solve puzzles!",
